      "output": "**SPEC.md has been created.** Here's a summary of what the specification covers:\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n- **7 requirements** mapped (R1–R7) covering UI text, HTML metadata, constants, social links, feature cards, unit tests, and E2E tests\n- **3 ADRs**: Direct text replacement over centralized branding config (YAGNI), assumed social handle conventions, and keeping the tagline unchanged\n- **4 Mermaid diagrams**: System architecture, user flow, component data flow, and sequence diagram\n- **6 component specifications**: Navbar, Footer, Hero, FeaturesGrid, CompanyInfoBlock, MissionStrip — all with props interfaces, event handlers, error handling, accessibility, and performance notes\n- **~12 files affected** across `apps/web`, `packages/ui`, and `e2e/`\n- **4-phase implementation checklist**: Constants → Props/Strings → Tests → Verification\n- **5 open questions** carried forward from requirements (tagline, social handles, email format, address, package names)\n\nNo structural, functional, or architectural changes — purely a text-level branding replacement across the monorepo.",
